{
  "$comment": "Hand-reviewed goldens for the paid client license (docs/spec/license.md). A human decided every `expected` value here; `scripts/gen-license-fixture.mjs` fills in ONLY the two test-only RSA key pairs and the `activation` strings derived from each case's `sign` block, because a signature is not something a reviewer can type. The private keys are test-only and are never used outside this file. Asserted by crates/futo-notes-license/tests/conformance.rs, which is wired into `just test-rust`. Timestamps are RFC 3339 UTC; `now` is the instant the case is evaluated at.",
  "testPayBaseUrl": "https://pay2.example.test",
  "linkOut": [
    {
      "name": "US iOS",
      "platform": "ios",
      "storefrontCountry": "USA",
      "buildAllows": true,
      "expected": true
    },
    {
